### Query a Solr collection
# Define {{solrUrl}} and {{collection}} in http-client.env.json so this
# file works for everyone who clones the repository.
GET http://localhost:8985/solr/books/select?q=*:*&rows=10
Accept: application/json

### B — minimal, no comments, no variables
GET http://localhost:8985/solr/books/select?q=*:*&rows=1

### C — a non-Solr URL, to see if anything runs at all
GET https://api.github.com/repos/apache/solr

### D — the shipped template form, for SRV-12 (needs the 'local' environment selected)
GET {{solrUrl}}/{{collection}}/select?q=*:*&rows=10
Accept: application/json
